    "body_normalized": "Minetest 524721ee2\n\n## How to reproduce\n\n1. Start with default settings (bloom disabled)\n2. Search for \"volumetric\" in settings tab\n\n## Actual behaviour\n\n3\\. Go insane because the GUI is lying to you and you know the setting exists\n\n## Expected behaviour\n\n3\\. There is some indication that the setting you are looking for exists, but is not available.",
